Package: youtube-subtitle-downloader
Version: %%VERSION%%
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Washington Indacochea Delgado <linuxfrontier@proton.me>
Installed-Size: %%INSTALLED_SIZE%%
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pyqt6, python3-pyqt6.qtsvg, yt-dlp | python3-yt-dlp
Recommends: ffmpeg
Description: download subtitles from YouTube using yt-dlp
 Desktop application (Python 3 + PyQt6) that fetches YouTube subtitles
 with yt-dlp and lets the user pick manual and automatic tracks, in
 SRT, VTT, TTML, JSON3 or the original format. Includes a clean TXT
 export, preview, history, playlists (MVP), an optional CLI and a full
 Spanish translation.
